ce mounts, and remediation coverage.\"}, \"deterministic_reproducible\": {\"outcome\": \"pass\", \"explanation\": \"Dependencies and environment are stable, and evaluation is fully deterministic in standard Tier 1+2 mode without relying on live external services.\"}, \"essential_difficulty\": {\"outcome\": \"pass\", \"explanation\": \"Difficulty stems from actual forensic investigation and evidence synthesis rather than formatting minutiae or artificial constraints.\"}, \"test_instruction_alignment\": {\"outcome\": \"pass\", \"explanation\": \"Test checks align directly with instruction requirements for the five report deliverables, citations, ATT&CK mappings, and remediation plan components.\"}, \"novel\": {\"outcome\": \"pass\", \"explanation\": \"The task features a custom synthetic forensic host image and multi-stage attack scenario.\"}, \"agentic\": {\"outcome\": \"pass\", \"explanation\": \"Requires multi-step environment exploration across /disk and /sas, analyzing diverse log formats, discovering unalerted persistence mechanisms, and synthesizing findings.\"}, \"reviewable\": {\"outcome\": \"pass\", \"explanation\": \"The instruction, ground-truth manifest.json, solve.sh, and test criteria clearly docu"]
